category: Libs
build-depends: cygport autoconf-archive gobject-introspection libfontconfig-devel libfreetype-devel libglib2.0-devel libharfbuzz-devel libxml2-devel
sdesc: "Easy configuration generator interface for fontconfig (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "libeasyfc is an interface library to generate fontconfig configuration for
user preferences. this supports to assign your preferrable fonts to the alias
fonts, such as sans-serif, serif and monospace per languages."
skip:

homepage: https://bitbucket.org/tagoh/libeasyfc/
license: LGPL-3.0-or-later
